  "title": "A.e.-strong measurability of the tangential derivative of a locally Lipschitz function (part (i), parent step 8)",
  "statement": "Let P, m ∈ ℕ, let M ⊆ ℝ^P be an embedded C¹ m-dimensional submanifold, and let ζ : ℝ^P → ℝ be locally Lipschitz on M. Let P_x be the orthogonal projection onto span(tangentSpace M x). Then x ↦ fderivWithin ℝ ζ M x ∘ P_x is a.e.-strongly measurable for μHE[m] restricted to M, as a map into continuous linear functionals on ℝ^P.",
  "lean_statement": "∀ (P m : ℕ) (M : Set (Euclid P)) (ζ : Euclid P → ℝ), IsEmbeddedSubmanifold 1 m M → LocallyLipschitzOn M ζ → AEStronglyMeasurable (fun x => (fderivWithin ℝ ζ M x).comp (Submodule.span ℝ (tangentSpace M x)).starProjection) (μHE[m].restrict M)",
